        "body": "## Summary\n- add default-disabled `core/doctor/legacy-cron-store` structured lint findings for legacy cron JSON stores, legacy run logs, quarantined rows, SQLite projection backfills, notify fallback, and stale dreaming payloads\n- add structured dry-run repair effects for the existing cron repair path: migrate/archive legacy stores, import run logs, quarantine invalid rows, normalize store shape, backfill SQLite projections, migrate `notify`, and rewrite stale dreaming payloads\n- keep selected lint and dry-run preview on read-only state inspection paths so they do not create or migrate the shared state DB\n- keep real mutation in the existing legacy `doctor --fix` cron contribution; structured non-dry-run repair reports `skipped`\n\n## Public surface\n- No public SDK/plugin/config contract changes.\n- Default `doctor --lint` is unchanged; this check runs with `--only core/doctor/legacy-cron-store` or `--all`.\n\n## ClawSweeper P1 follow-up\n- Fixed selected lint/dry-run preview using writable shared-state DB open paths.\n- Added regression coverage proving `collectLegacyCronStoreHealthFindings` and `collectLegacyCronStoreRepairEffects` do not create the shared state DB while previewing legacy cron state.\n\n## PR surface\n- 7 files changed, +707/-4 from `main`.\n\n## Validation\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/commands/doctor/cron/index.test.ts src/flows/doctor-health-contributions.test.ts` (118 tests)\n- `pnpm exec oxfmt --check src/commands/doctor/cron/index.ts src/commands/doctor/cron/index.test.ts src/commands/doctor/cron/migration-ledger.ts src/cron/store.ts src/flows/doctor-core-checks.ts src/flows/doctor-health-contributions.test.ts`\n- `pnpm exec oxlint src/commands/doctor/cron/index.ts src/commands/doctor/cron/index.test.ts src/commands/doctor/cron/migration-ledger.ts src/cron/store.ts src/flows/doctor-core-checks.ts src/flows/doctor-health-contributions.test.ts`\n- `node scripts/plugin-sdk-surface-report.mjs --check`\n- `git diff --check`\n\n## Not completed locally\n- `pnpm tsgo:core` and `pnpm tsgo:core:test` timed out on Windows after 5 minutes without diagnostics.\n- Earlier source CLI proof using throwaway `--profile doctor-cron-proof-*` timed out because each invocation rebuilt the dirty-tree runtime; generated proof profiles were removed.",
